{"version":1,"content":"<p>雅達利宣佈，將停止為2021年推出的VCS主機提供後續支持。這款復刻版主機以1977年發佈的初代雅達利VCS（後更名為雅達利2600）為設計原型，2020年率先交付給Kickstarter眾籌支持者，次年正式全面發售。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1583684.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:02:25.888455+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T10:43:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:58:09.466558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:58:09.466558+00:00","content_hash":"94f96643982a07f0dabaa38bc668a16663f023190005b5a5adc62377cb074dc9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}